From: Vahiru <nekovahiru@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: default new networks to per-network MAC randomization

crDroid makes RANDOMIZATION_ALWAYS the default of
WifiConfiguration.macRandomizationSetting, and WifiConfigurationUtil
compares against it to tell whether an app changed the setting.
Networks added outside the Settings dialog, by apps or as suggestions,
then get a new MAC address on every connection. crDroid's Settings no
longer offers that option and saves new networks as RANDOMIZATION_AUTO.

Restore the AOSP default, RANDOMIZATION_AUTO, in both places. They must
match, or WifiConfigManager rejects addNetwork() from normal apps as a
change of the randomization setting. RANDOMIZATION_ALWAYS itself still
works, and saved networks keep their stored setting. The device overlay
currently disables connected MAC randomization, so the address in use
does not change; the new default takes effect once randomization is
enabled. Goes with patches/android/frameworks-opt-net-wifi/0001.

Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [device-specific policy]
---
 framework/java/android/net/wifi/WifiConfiguration.java          | 2 +-
 service/java/com/android/server/wifi/WifiConfigurationUtil.java | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/framework/java/android/net/wifi/WifiConfiguration.java b/framework/java/android/net/wifi/WifiConfiguration.java
index 32d5dbb..e4bcac8 100644
--- a/framework/java/android/net/wifi/WifiConfiguration.java
+++ b/framework/java/android/net/wifi/WifiConfiguration.java
@@ -1931,7 +1931,7 @@ public class WifiConfiguration implements Parcelable {
      */
     @SystemApi
     @MacRandomizationSetting
-    public int macRandomizationSetting = RANDOMIZATION_ALWAYS;
+    public int macRandomizationSetting = RANDOMIZATION_AUTO;  // AOSP default
 
     /**
      * Set the MAC randomization setting for this network.
diff --git a/service/java/com/android/server/wifi/WifiConfigurationUtil.java b/service/java/com/android/server/wifi/WifiConfigurationUtil.java
index fa0243f..7cdb9d7 100644
--- a/service/java/com/android/server/wifi/WifiConfigurationUtil.java
+++ b/service/java/com/android/server/wifi/WifiConfigurationUtil.java
@@ -281,7 +281,7 @@ public class WifiConfigurationUtil {
     public static boolean hasMacRandomizationSettingsChanged(WifiConfiguration existingConfig,
             WifiConfiguration newConfig) {
         if (existingConfig == null) {
-            return newConfig.macRandomizationSetting != WifiConfiguration.RANDOMIZATION_ALWAYS;
+            return newConfig.macRandomizationSetting != WifiConfiguration.RANDOMIZATION_AUTO;  // must match the field default
         }
         return newConfig.macRandomizationSetting != existingConfig.macRandomizationSetting;
     }
